<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling eases versus dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling eases versus dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell against the dollar and pound on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>They posted the shilling at a mean of 597.0987 compared to 596.9700 on Wednesday. Against the pound, the dollar was quoted at an average of 975.0652 from 961.5426 previously.</p>
</text>
